# Flow 6, delete: a 3 s hold on a note's row (the cue, then the options), Delete note, Yes: the note moves to the vault's
# .trash folder and leaves the list; Delete from the editor's More keeps the text as typed; Ctrl+O is the hold's key.
seed vault
wait 900
tap "All notes"
tap "All notes"
wait 300
tap "Projects"
tap "Projects"
wait 400
key end
wait 200
hold "Parts list" 1500 01-hold-cue
wait 300
expect state popup none
hold "Parts list" 3300
wait 400
expect state popup menu
shot 02-options
tap "Delete note"
wait 400
expect state popup confirm
expect text "Parts list moves to the .trash folder of the vault."
shot 03-confirm
check confirm
tap "Yes"
wait 500
expect state popup none
expect file "Projects/Parts list.md" missing
expect file ".trash/Parts list.md" exists
expect notext "Parts list"
shot 04-deleted
# from the editor: More > Delete note (the last note of the folder)
key end
key enter
wait 500
key ctrl-e
wait 400
key ctrl-end
type  Last words.
# the options box by a 3 s hold on the text (no bars); its last row, Delete note
holdat 0.5 0.5 3300
wait 400
expect state popup menu
key end
key enter
wait 400
expect state popup confirm
tap "Yes"
wait 500
expect state page folder
expect file "Projects/Antenna ideas.md" missing
expect file ".trash/Antenna ideas.md" contains "Last words."
# Ctrl+O on a note, No keeps it
key esc
wait 300
key end
key ctrl-o
wait 400
expect state popup menu
key enter
wait 400
expect state popup confirm
key enter
wait 300
expect state popup none
expect file "Welcome.md" exists
